  "description": "Kyung has grown distant from Ji-Woo, who he's been close with since high school, but they end up taking the same class at the same university! He wants to know why he's keeping his distance, but Ji-Woo won't say anything. On top of that, he meets some beggarly group members who just fare evasion, and his grades are seriously failing. Damn it. Should he take a leave of absence? Kyung returns home, visibly annoyed, and heads to the bathroom when he suddenly sees Ji-Woo popping out of the mirror. \n\nWhat the? Why are you coming out of there? Why are you sucking my XX?!\n\n(Source: Mr.Blue, translated)",
